From f62ff048443c9752f573457808a7919fb5b5cdcd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiacheng Zheng <jiaczhen@codeaurora.org>
Date: Fri, 29 Jan 2021 15:50:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] parallelize audio and pcie driver to improve bootkpi

Audio driver takes the most booting time, so we pick
out all audio dependency chain and run them in a
separate thread. Pcie init also takes some time and we
can define it as asynchronous to save more time.
Finally, we postpone the calling of wait_for_device_probe
after the mounting of rootfs so considerable rootfs mounting
time can be hidden in parallel with audio driver init.

Change-Id: I08f1e8c7089afc55acc4236051e3b0e2594c983d
Signed-off-by: Jiacheng Zheng <jiaczhen@codeaurora.org>
